# Backup files written by retrofit/generator scripts. GitHub Pages serves every
# file in this repo, so a committed backup is a publicly reachable near-duplicate
# of the page next to it — exactly the duplicate content we are trying to avoid.
#
# `*.bak` only matches names ENDING in .bak. Two files named
# `index.html.bak-trafficloop` slipped past it and were served live at
# theskillmillbooks.com until 2026-08-03. Any suffix after .bak must match too,
# so keep the `*.bak*` form below rather than reverting to a bare `*.bak`.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak-*
*.pre-capture.bak
*.orig
*~

# Local editor/agent config — contains local filesystem paths, not site content.
.claude/
